event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_0cfa1451c3a01cbe016ac9464499dc87d2a12954a4adcc99e6","output_index":0,"sequence_number":90,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing project modules**\n\nI need to implement simple modules for a server and database, then set up frontend tests for Node integration. There's plenty of time left, so I’m thinking of choosing a static predefined server while also creating API projects to handle GET requests. I plan to create a database directory and set it up with default data. I’ll make sure to have a robust request body limit to handle errors. My frontend will be an SPA with navigation."}

